      "writtenOn": "2021-05-14T20:40:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if we check whether \u0027partial \u003d\u003d true\u0027 here, and skip the user if it is. That way, if a precreated user has already been slated for removal, it won\u0027t get returned here, and therefore won\u0027t end up being converted and then immediately removed.\n\nFelipe, wdyt?",
      "revId": "35b0509996ffd490b849315dbd544bc66150e8ad",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
