      "writtenOn": "2021-07-20T13:32:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Adam, let me share my opinion.\nIn general, I agree that an additional check should be added here to prevent a possible race. I\u0027ve explored the existed code and as I can see, to mark a user as \"removal in progress\" is usually used the `UserInfo.FLAG_DISABLED` flag. So in my opinion using `!user.info.isInitialized()` would be more expressive than `user.info.partial`.\nDo you agree?",
